A15 long_text Is the patient entered on Sex Offenders’ Regi => [('v3_18', 'text', 'Is the patient entered on Sex Offenders’ Register or subject to a Sexual Offences/Sexual Harm Prevention Order or any other criminal or civil orders of a court which are relevant? Whether the patient is a ViSOR nominal?', 'Patient’s Details > Is the patient entered on Sex Offenders’ Register or subject to a Sexual Offences/Sexual Harm Prevention Order or any ot', {'type': 'cell'})]
A16 long_text Details of the MDT members and organisations  => [('v3_19', 'long_text', 'Details of the MDT members and organisations involved in supporting the patient, name, role and contact details', 'Patient’s Details > Details of the MDT members and organisations involved in supporting the patient, name, role and contact details', {'type': 'cell_replace', 'all': True})]
A17 long_text Set out any changes since the previous report => [('v3_20', 'long_text', 'Set out any changes since the previous report or since the patient has been discharged where there are concerns about changes in the patient’s mental state or risk profile? Please use the relevant section to elaborate further.', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report', {'type': 'cell'})]
A18 long_text When was the last time you saw the patient an => [('v3_21', 'long_text', 'When was the last time you saw the patient and was this in person? Where did you last see the patient? How often do you or other members of the team see the patient and has contact been more frequent or less frequent over the reporting period?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Supervision', {'type': 'cell'})]
A19 long_text Does the patient cooperate with supervision?  => [('v3_22', 'long_text', 'Does the patient cooperate with supervision? Can the cooperation with supervision be described as active or are they passively engaging with supervision? Have they historically cooperated and what have been the barriers to effective supervision either now or in the past?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Supervision', {'type': 'cell'})]
