A22 long_text Set out the suitability of the accommodation  => [('v3_23', 'long_text', 'Set out the suitability of the accommodation and its appropriateness for monitoring of compliance with treatment and risk?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Accommodation', {'type': 'cell'})]
A23 long_text If accommodation is being changed, please set => [('v3_24', 'long_text', 'If accommodation is being changed, please set out the reasons for the changes and what level of support the new accommodation will entail? Please also detail any specific risk assessment/review activity and any changes to risk mitigations. Has there been formal notification through the following process Submit a conditional discharge report or request a change of discharge conditions - GOV.UK (www.gov.uk)?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Accommodation', {'type': 'cell'})]
A24 long_text Have there been any changes in the relationsh => [('v3_25', 'long_text', 'Have there been any changes in the relationships which are significant to the patient, and which may affect their stability? Are any changes likely to take place before the next report is due?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Relationships', {'type': 'cell'})]
A25 long_text If the case has a specific condition relating => [('v3_26', 'long_text', 'If the case has a specific condition relating to relationships or reporting relationships how is this condition monitored?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Relationships', {'type': 'cell'})]
A26 long_text In relation to the above question have you as => []
A27 long_text Please report any changes or variation of the => [('v3_27', 'long_text', 'Please report any changes or variation of the patient’s mental state and behaviour which have increased your concerns about the appropriateness of the conditional discharge continuing? Please include if the case has been referred to MAPPA or a MARAC has been arranged.', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Behaviour and Risks', {'type': 'cell'})]
A28 long_text Please set out the patient’s historical risks => [('v3_28', 'long_text', 'Please set out the patient’s historical risks, how they are being managed now and what has been done to manage them in the past?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Behaviour and Risks', {'type': 'cell'})]
A29 long_text Has the patient displayed any signs of extrem => [('v3_29', 'long_text', 'Has the patient displayed any signs of extremist / terrorist risk ideology or behaviour and if so, how is this being managed? Has the patient been referred to Prevent or are other agencies engaged with managing this risk?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Behaviour and Risks', {'type': 'cell'})]
A30 long_text Have there been any recent issues of concern  => [('v3_30', 'long_text', 'Have there been any recent issues of concern relating to drug or alcohol use by the patient? Is the patient being targeted by local drug users or dealers? If so, please detail the action taken to address any increased risks which may occur because of this.', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Substance Misuse Risks', {'type': 'cell'})]
A31 long_text Is the patient a habitual user of controlled  => [('v3_31', 'long_text', 'Is the patient a habitual user of controlled drugs? If, yes how is this risk managed?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Substance Misuse Risks', {'type': 'cell'})]
A32 long_text Historically does the patient pose a risk to  => [('v3_32', 'long_text', 'Historically does the patient pose a risk to specific individuals or groups? Are those risks likely to re-emerge on discharge?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Past and Potential Victims', {'type': 'cell'})]
A33 long_text Has the patient been adhering to any victim r => [('v3_33', 'long_text', 'Has the patient been adhering to any victim related conditions, such as non-contact conditions or exclusion zones? Have they sought changes to victim related conditions? Are you in contact with the Victim Liaison Officer?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Past and Potential Victims', {'type': 'cell'})]
A34 long_text Is the patient financially independent or are => [('v3_34', 'long_text', 'Is the patient financially independent or are they reliant on third parties for financial support, such as family or friends? Is the patient in any danger of being financially exploited by others?', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Financial Risk', {'type': 'cell'})]
A35 long_text What structured activities does the patient p => [('v3_35', 'long_text', 'What structured activities does the patient partake in including employment, study, or other interests? If the patient has no structured activity, how do they occupy their time and will this pose a problem from a risk perspective in the long term? Have they been supported in disclosure of their offending history (where appropriate?)', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Activities and Employment', {'type': 'cell'})]
A36 long_text Provide any further comments or any colleague => [('v3_36', 'long_text', 'Provide any further comments or any colleague involved in the patient’s supervision.', 'Part B > Social Supervisor’s Report > Further Comments', {'type': 'cell'})]
