A44 long_text Please set out any clinical changes or concer => [('v3_47', 'long_text', 'Please set out any clinical changes or concerns around risk since the previous report (or, in the case of the initial report, in the four weeks since the patient was discharged)? Please use the relevant section to elaborate further.', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report', {'type': 'cell'})]
A45 long_text What is the patient’s diagnosis? Has this cha => [('v3_48', 'long_text', 'What is the patient’s diagnosis? Has this changed over the course of their time in the community?', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Diagnosis', {'type': 'cell'})]
A46 long_text What are the primary factors that affect the  => [('v3_49', 'long_text', 'What are the primary factors that affect the stability of the patient’s mental state and how does this effect their risk?', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Diagnosis', {'type': 'cell'})]
A47 long_text Please set out the medication prescribed to t => [('v3_50', 'long_text', 'Please set out the medication prescribed to the patient to treat their mental disorder and how this is administered and monitored?', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Treatment', {'type': 'cell'})]
A48 long_text Does the patient self-medicate? Has there bee => [('v3_51', 'long_text', 'Does the patient self-medicate? Has there been any change to the dosage or type of medication being prescribed and what insight does the patient have?', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Treatment', {'type': 'cell'})]
A49 long_text Has the patient fully complied with treatment => [('v3_52', 'long_text', 'Has the patient fully complied with treatment including taking prescribed medication? If not, please detail the action taken to address this.', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Treatment', {'type': 'cell'})]
A50 long_text Has the Care Plan changed or are there any pl => [('v3_53', 'long_text', 'Has the Care Plan changed or are there any plans to change it as a result of increased/decreased concerns?', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Treatment', {'type': 'cell'})]
A51 long_text Have there been any physical illnesses, or ch => [('v3_54', 'long_text', 'Have there been any physical illnesses, or change in existing physical condition, which has impacted upon the patient’s mental health or compliance with treatment?', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Physical Health', {'type': 'cell'})]
A52 long_text Please set out any recent events or behaviour => [('v3_55', 'long_text', 'Please set out any recent events or behaviours which have required interventions or raised concerns with supervisors?', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Risk Concerns', {'type': 'cell'})]
A53 long_text Has the patient had any informal admissions t => [('v3_56', 'long_text', 'Has the patient had any informal admissions to hospital or admissions under the Mental Health Act 1983 (including s2 and s3)? What were the circumstances and outcome?', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Admissions to hospital', {'type': 'cell'})]
A54 long_text When was the patient last seen by you or by a => [('v3_57', 'long_text', 'When was the patient last seen by you or by another clinical professional (e.g. Locum, CPN)? Please give dates of the last CPA or professionals meeting in relation to the patient, inclusive of MAPPA meetings.', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Supervision', {'type': 'cell'})]
A55 long_text Provide details of any other interventions th => [('v3_58', 'long_text', 'Provide details of any other interventions the patient is undertaking, why these interventions are necessary and how they affect risk?', 'Part C > Clinical Supervisor’s Report > Supervision', {'type': 'cell'})]
